  triage:title "Stale boundary-TOML record references nonexistent SendRequestEnvelope type" ;
  triage:description "AI7-QA-1 (req-qa confirmation). The boundary TOML file boundaries/atm-graft/shared-client-consumer.toml:46 contains a stale reference to SendRequestEnvelope type. This type was supposed to be deleted as part of AI.7's Deliverable 4: 'delete duplicate send/ack envelopes, handlers, persistence/nudge branches, and host-routing decisions. The deletion inventory is every retained Compose/DirectDeliver-equivalent pair, separate ack sender, sender-side ack mutation, and any host check outside PostWriteRouter.' SendRequestEnvelope appears to have been deleted from source code but the boundary record was not updated." ;
